  "description": "Han-Gyeol , who was treated like a fool by his ex, ended up cheating on him after a long relationship. To console his empty heart, he decides to vacation in the countryside where he lived with his parents as a child. His damned ex-lover is too busy fucking someone else, so he feels heavy inside. Han-Gyeol, enjoying a relaxing masturbation session at home during his rare vacation, is caught by a strange man...?! But that man is Sung-Chan, the kid next door who used to play with him?\n\n\"You were the one who asked me to marry you first...!\"\n\nSung-Chan presses him, mentioning a mysterious proposal Han-Gyeol made in the past. Well, I can't remember a thing about it!\n\n(Source: MrBlue, translated)",
